From: irgend wer <irgend@wer.de>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:37:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] libcamera: camera_sensor_properties: Add IMX241

Add static properties for the Sony IMX241. The sensor is a type 1/5
(3.63 mm diagonal) back-illuminated CMOS sensor with 2592x1944 active
pixels of 1.12 um. The pixel size is taken from a distributor's
specification (FRAMOS), not from a Sony datasheet.

The test pattern menu of the imx241 kernel driver follows the SMIA
test_pattern_mode register (0x0600): solid colour, colour bars, fade to
grey colour bars and PN9. The sensor delays are not known yet; the
defaults apply.

Signed-off-by: TODO <TODO>
---
 src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp b/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
index 28043150e..3604069c1 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
@@ -210,6 +210,17 @@ const CameraSensorProperties *CameraSensorProperties::get(const std::string &sen
 				.hblankDelay = 2
 			},
 		} },
+		{ "imx241", {
+			.unitCellSize = { 1120, 1120 },
+			.testPatternModes = {
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModeOff, 0 },
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModeSolidColor, 1 },
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModeColorBars, 2 },
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModeColorBarsFadeToGray, 3 },
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModePn9, 4 },
+			},
+			.sensorDelays = { },
+		} },
 		{ "imx258", {
 			.unitCellSize = { 1120, 1120 },
 			.testPatternModes = {
